    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "今天是国庆节，学校放假7天，很多同学都去旅游了。",
      "traditional": "今天是國慶節，學校放假7天，很多同學都去旅遊了。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì guó qìng jié xué xiào fàng jià 1 tiān hěn duō tóng xué dōu qù lǚ yóu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我也很想去旅游，",
      "traditional": "我也很想去旅遊，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yě hěn xiǎng qù lǚ yóu",
      "english": "Today is China’s National Day. School is off for 7 days, and a lot of classmates are out traveling."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "但是国庆节大家都放假，去哪儿人都很多。",
      "traditional": "但是國慶節大家都放假，去哪兒人都很多。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì guó qìng jié dà jiā dōu fàng jià qù nǎ'r rén dōu hěn duō",
      "english": "I also want to go traveling."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我不喜欢人多的地方。",
      "traditional": "我不喜歡人多的地方。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ bù xǐ huan rén duō de dì fang",
      "english": "But on National Day everyone has a vacation, so there’re lots of people no matter where you go."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "现在，大家都去玩了，学校人很少。",
      "traditional": "現在，大家都去玩了，學校人很少。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài dà jiā dōu qù wán le xué xiào rén hěn shǎo",
      "english": "I don’t like places with too many people."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我要在学校看书，我要考HSK3级了。",
      "traditional": "我要在學校看書，我要考HSK3級了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yào zài xué xiào kàn shū wǒ yào kǎo 3 1 jí le",
      "english": "Now, everyone has already left to have fun, and very few people are at school."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I have to stay at the school to study because I am taking the HSK3 exam."
    }
  ],
